The fact-check confirms that President Trump tested positive for COVID-19 on October 1, 2020, but found that [E-6B Mercury aircraft are routinely deployed](https://www.naval-technology.com/projects/e6a-bmercurytacamoco/) to maintain continuous airborne alert for nuclear command. The specific flight observed was officially described as a routine ["Take Charge And Move Out" (TACAMO) mission](https://www.thedrive.com/the-war-zone/31477/heres-why-an-e-6b-doomsday-plane-was-flying-tight-circles-off-the-jersey-shore-today) for submarine communications, with no evidence linking it to the President's diagnosis. Therefore, the claim is refuted.